{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_380960","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Boss，听我说。\n多亏了你，MSF的规模也已经相当大了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不过既然发展到这个地步，\n再不认真考虑粮食问题就不行了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是啊。毕竟是海上平台，储备也必不可少。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"日本有句谚语：\n“饿着肚子打不了仗。”\n日本在二战中就吃过这个教训。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"食物供应本来就是后勤的基础……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"所以，我成立了一个“伙食班”。\nMother Base的食物供应率，\n会随着伙食班的人数和能力发生变化。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":131,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"如果食物供应不足，士兵的士气就会下降，\n饿得太厉害的话，甚至会有人逃走。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"事不宜迟，给伙食班安排些人手吧。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"了解。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":10,"review_flag":""}]}